# The free sample is made and saved on the reader: the shelf starts empty,
# Now playing names the sample with the honest firmware note where the sim
# has no audio backend, and the shelf keeps it afterwards.
wait-for Audiobooks
expect Nothing here yet
clean
shot audiobook-empty
tap-id sample
wait-for Now playing
expect The Quiet Shelf
expect Saved on this reader
clean
shot audiobook-playing
tap back
wait-for Audiobooks
expect The Quiet Shelf
expect-missing Nothing here yet
clean
shot audiobook-shelf
# With no keys on the reader, Create names the exact command for each key,
# keeps the topic, and checks again rather than throwing the topic away.
tap Create
wait-for Your topic
tap Type any topic
type the moon
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for Add your keys
expect kobo secret set exa
expect kobo secret set openai
expect kobo secret set elevenlabs
expect Nothing has been spent
expect-missing Try another topic
expect-missing Permission needed
clean
shot audiobook-keys
tap Check again
wait-for Add your keys
tap Edit topic
wait-for Your topic
expect the moon
clean
shot audiobook-topic-kept
